  "details": "Sometimes when you are playing VRChat, there are worlds like \"Japan Shrine（ https://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_736bad27-4663-4346-a345-26e1e859d94e ）\" that have heavy world effects and other effects.\n\nIf you know the names of these worlds, you can avoid them, but if you don't, the frame rate of your HMD may drop and become choppy, or worse, VRChat may crash.\n\nTo prevent this, I would like to see a drawing limit item added for worlds, like the limit in the avatar settings.",
